    "historyOfPresentIllness": "The patient is a 22-year-old male who presents after being attacked by two dogs while going door to door for work. He reports that upon approaching a client's residence, two dogs charged out of the house and knocked him to the ground. He sustained a bite wound to the left elbow and injury to the right knee upon falling.\n\nHe reports pain, swelling, and bruising to the right lateral knee. He denies any locking, giving way, or inability to bear weight, however he endorses extreme pain with weight bearing. He denies any other bite wounds, loss of consciousness, or head strike during the fall.",
